Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS}\N{\c&Hff8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:04.56,Titulo do ep,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Dunkleosteus Comedy Contest{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a live show with the Idol Club,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't decide on an outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at those cute frills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Frills?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That might actually work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Eww, wait! What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Triceratops skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is a juvenile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but adults are much bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's jump...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,into the WORLD OF SERIOUS PALEONTOLOGY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not going!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.59,0:01:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an adult Triceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Its name means "three-horned face"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It features a short horn on its nose and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,two long ones on its brow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,totaling three horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The horns look different between juveniles and adults, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And another thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The neck crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,this frill is also a major feature of Triceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they have frills?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.07,0:02:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It was used by males to show off to females!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,To show off?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And then,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Tyrannosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The frill also protected their vital neck from carnivorous dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.49,0:02:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Triceratops skulls are extremely hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinosaurs with frills and face horns are called Ceratopsians!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any other kinds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.61,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pachyrhinosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It has hair all over its body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It also has large bony bosses above its eyes and nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Theories suggest males used them in fights
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:03:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,or to attract females!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was for showing off after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,if other ceratopsians broke a horn, it stayed broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but Pachyrhinosaurus might have been able to regenerate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a lizard's tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.47,0:03:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And look...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There are holes in the frill!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many other ceratopsians as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Chasmosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Its frill might have had eye-like patterns to intimidate enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a frog paralyzed by a snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And over here is Styracosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A ceratopsian with a total of seven sharp spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Spikes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ceratopsians!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So frills came in all sorts of varieties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There were many dinosaurs with frills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Triceratops skulls were especially solid,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,which is why so many of their fossils survive to this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To survive as an idol, you need toughness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,a rock-solid resolve to succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tetori is using Triceratops to teach me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,, I bestow this upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.31,0:04:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Become an idol like a Triceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tricera-idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.21,0:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to show off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,LIKE I EVER COULD!
